The agent pays the invoice. The receipt cites the mandate.

5
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:26,210
The owner names a stranger. The gate refuses. The payee was never in the mandate.

6
00:00:30,350 --> 00:00:33,490
The poster is data. A TV ad is not your voice.

7
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:45,630
We tested a frontier model. Undefended, DeepSeek paid half the invoices. Behind the gate, zero. 18 of 18 receipts verified.

8
00:00:45,750 --> 00:00:49,540
Open the audit bundle in a browser. Verified cross-model.

9
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:59,060
Everyone is building agents that can do things. This is the one you can hand your wallet to.
